  23:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   ==============================================================================
  24:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****                     ##### GPIO Peripheral features #####
  25:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   ==============================================================================
  26:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   [..] 
  27:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   Subject to the specific hardware characteristics of each I/O port listed in the datasheet, each
  28:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   port bit of the General Purpose IO (GPIO) Ports, can be individually configured by software
  29:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   in several modes:
  30:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   (+) Input mode 
  31:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   (+) Analog mode
ARM GAS  /var/folders/8x/_y6g3dfs0698dfd49y4vcg_w0000gn/T//ccWLsXsz.s 			page 2


  32:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   (+) Output mode
  33:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   (+) Alternate function mode
  34:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   (+) External interrupt/event lines
  35:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c **** 
  36:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   [..]  
  37:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   During and just after reset, the alternate functions and external interrupt  
  38:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   lines are not active and the I/O ports are configured in input floating mode.
  39:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   
  40:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   [..]   
  41:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   All GPIO pins have weak internal pull-up and pull-down resistors, which can be 
  42:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   activated or not.
  43:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c **** 
  44:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   [..]
  45:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   In Output or Alternate mode, each IO can be configured on open-drain or push-pull
  46:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   type and the IO speed can be selected depending on the VDD value.
  47:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c **** 
  48:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   [..]  
  49:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   All ports have external interrupt/event capability. To use external interrupt 
  50:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   lines, the port must be configured in input mode. All available GPIO pins are 
  51:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   connected to the 16 external interrupt/event lines from EXTI0 to EXTI15.
  52:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   
  53:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   [..]
  54:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   The external interrupt/event controller consists of up to 23 edge detectors 
  55:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   (16 lines are connected to GPIO) for generating event/interrupt requests (each 
  56:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   input line can be independently configured to select the type (interrupt or event) 
  57:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   and the corresponding trigger event (rising or falling or both). Each line can 
  58:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   also be masked independently. 
  59:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c **** 
  60:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****                      ##### How to use this driver #####
  61:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   ==============================================================================  
  62:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****   [..]
  63:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****     (#) Enable the GPIO AHB clock using the following function: __HAL_RCC_GPIOx_CLK_ENABLE(). 
  64:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c **** 
  65:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****     (#) Configure the GPIO pin(s) using HAL_GPIO_Init().
  66:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****         (++) Configure the IO mode using "Mode" member from GPIO_InitTypeDef structure
  67:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****         (++) Activate Pull-up, Pull-down resistor using "Pull" member from GPIO_InitTypeDef 
  68:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****              structure.
  69:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****         (++) In case of Output or alternate function mode selection: the speed is 
  70:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****              configured through "Speed" member from GPIO_InitTypeDef structure.
  71:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****         (++) In alternate mode is selection, the alternate function connected to the IO
  72:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****              is configured through "Alternate" member from GPIO_InitTypeDef structure.
  73:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****         (++) Analog mode is required when a pin is to be used as ADC channel 
  74:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****              or DAC output.
  75:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****         (++) In case of external interrupt/event selection the "Mode" member from 
  76:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****              GPIO_InitTypeDef structure select the type (interrupt or event) and 
  77:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****              the corresponding trigger event (rising or falling or both).
  78:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c **** 
  79:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****     (#) In case of external interrupt/event mode selection, configure NVIC IRQ priority 
  80:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****         mapped to the EXTI line using HAL_NVIC_SetPriority() and enable it using
  81:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****         HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ().
  82:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****          
  83:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****     (#) To get the level of a pin configured in input mode use HAL_GPIO_ReadPin().
  84:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****             
  85:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****     (#) To set/reset the level of a pin configured in output mode use 
  86:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****         HAL_GPIO_WritePin()/HAL_GPIO_TogglePin().
  87:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****     
  88:Drivers/STM32F2xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f2xx_hal_gpio.c ****     (#) To lock pin configuration until next reset use HAL_GPIO_LockPin().
